      "id": "claim_430b059122b84ae5848ab9d763db1659",
      "statement": "The desktop delivery hand-off answers both delivery IPC calls by projecting the saved model on disk: registerDeliveryIpc normalizes a folder-or-bundle project root with modelSourceOf(projectDirectoryOf(rootPath)) and calls readDelivery, so preview and export describe what a colleague receives rather than the unsaved canvas.",
